  "subject": "four office colleagues doing the Oxfam Trailwalker, 100 km of the MacLehose Trail in under 48 hours where all four must cross the line together, and the one who sits down on the Lion Rock steps at 3 a.m. to quit",
  "caption": "Cantonese nu-metal in the turn-of-the-millennium rap-metal mould, Hong Kong LMF lineage. Two seven-string guitars drop-tuned and palm-muted into syncopated chugging riffs, a growling fingerstyle bass locked to the kick drum, heavy groove drums with a dry snare and crash-heavy choruses, and a DJ cutting short turntable scratches on drum hits between lines. Tight, loud, mid-scooped late-90s rock mix with wide guitars. A male lead rapping the verses in hard, clipped Cantonese, three band members shouting the chorus as a gang, the lead breaking into a raw sung-screamed hook. 96 BPM, D minor. Grinding, stubborn, sweaty and a bit absurd. No trap hi-hats, no metalcore breakdown, no EDM synths, no pop-punk, no autotune.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n北潭涌出發 朝早九點\n四個坐寫字樓 坐到生鏽嘅同事\n四十八個鐘 一百公里\n麥理浩徑 由東一路行到西\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n規矩得一條 個個記住\n四個一齊出發 四個一齊到\n\n[Chorus]\n一級 一級 踩上去\n膝頭喊救命 都踩上去\n你坐低 我哋就等\n四個一齊 先算到\n\n[Verse]\n凌晨三點 獅子山 條樓梯冇盡頭\n頭燈閃兩閃 就冇晒電\n阿Ken坐低 除咗對鞋\n話佢退出 叫我哋三個行先\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我哋三個 坐埋佢隔籬\n佢個背囊 拆開三份孭\n\n[Chorus]\n一級 一級 踩上去\n你唔郁 我哋都唔郁\n你坐低 我哋就等\n四個一齊 先算到\n\n[Verse]\n城門水塘 馬騮搶咗我哋啲香蕉\n阿Ken追咗佢 足足一百米\n原來仲有力 頭先扮死\n大帽山霧大到 睇唔到自己對腳\n\n[Bridge]\n四十一個鐘 大棠終點\n四個人拖實手 踩過條線\n阿Ken喊到 鼻涕都流埋落嚟\n\n[Chorus]\n一級 一級 踩過嚟\n膝頭冇晒知覺 都踩過嚟\n冇人坐低 冇人等\n四個一齊 終於到\n\n[Outro]\n阿Ken話 下年唔嚟\n報名表 佢第一個交",
